{"ref":"BDB, מַחְמֹד","hw":"מַחְמֹד","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְמֹד</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>desirable, precious thing</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמֻדֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:7\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.7\">La 1:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמוֹדֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.11\">La 1:11</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדֵּיהֶם</span>). Perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲמַדּ׳</span> to be read in both; cf. Sta<sup>§ 273 a</sup>.","next":"BDB, חמה","prev":"BDB, מַחְמַד"}